      "content": "idk the ibuprofen isn't really doing anything and the throbbing is making it worse. i'm kind of worried because it's just so different from my usual migraines... like the pain is everywhere and i feel super lightheaded. do you think i should maybe take a higher dose of the sumatriptan? i have some extra pills and i really just need this to go away so i can sleep.",
